                            <td width="67%"><div align="justify"> <font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">This 
                                item provides a list of vehicles that meet the 
                                criteria determined by the user. Vehicles can 
                                be queried by make, type, cost center, organizational 
